## Academic Use

If you use this software in academic research, please cite:

```bibtex
@software{critical_ga_2025,
  title={Critical Network Disruption Problem - Genetic Algorithm Implementation},
  author={Tamás Kálmán},
  year={2025},
  url={https://github.com/kepestamas/Critical-GA},
  note={GitHub repository}
}
```

For specific datasets, please also cite the original data sources as documented
in the dataset attribution section above and in docs/DATASETS.md.

